# Planted: a time that is not a time, a quote that is not closed, an hour out of range, a statement that does not exist.
scene bad-syntax
at 1:99 mark one     #! expect error bad time '1:99'
at 2 label "no end quote     #! expect error a double quote is not closed
at 3 hour 60     #! expect error bad hour '60'
at 4 dance     #! expect error unknown statement 'dance'
end 6
